;RESIDUE NUMBERING FOLLOWS THE ORDER OF APPEARANCE IN THE
SEQUENCE.  THIS NUMBERING CORRESPONDS TO THE ONE USED IN
THE PAPER IDENTIFYING THE DEPOSITED SET OF COORDINATES.

THE SEQUENCES OF THE CONSTANT DOMAINS OF THE HEAVY CHAINS
(RESIDUES 110 - 227) AND OF THE LIGHT CHAINS (RESIDUES
106 - 214) HAVE NOT BEEN DETERMINED FOR THIS
IMMUNOGLOBULIN.  THEY HAVE BEEN ASSIGNED THE CONSENSUS
SEQUENCES FOR THE CONSTANT DOMAIN OF MOUSE KAPPA LIGHT
CHAIN AND FOR THE FIRST CONSTANT DOMAIN OF MOUSE GROUP IIA
HEAVY CHAINS.
